@startuml
title Sequence diagram: frame-to-command pipeline

actor Operator
participant "VideoCapture" as Capture
participant "HandDetector" as Detector
participant "StaticGestureClassifier" as Static
participant "TrajectoryBuffer" as Buffer
participant "DynamicGestureClassifier" as Dynamic
participant "CommandMapper" as Mapper
participant "CommandSender" as Sender

Operator -> Capture : performs gesture
Capture -> Detector : frame
Detector -> Static : landmarks
Static --> Mapper : static prediction
Detector -> Buffer : landmarks
Buffer -> Dynamic : trajectory window
Dynamic --> Mapper : dynamic prediction
Mapper -> Mapper : debounce and safety filter
Mapper --> Sender : confirmed command
Sender --> Operator : robot action / feedback

@enduml
